{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13197","headline":"送张南史 · 皇甫冉","name":"送张南史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马卿工词赋，位下年将暮。\n谢客爱云山，家贫身不闲。\n风波杳未极，几处逢相识。\n富贵人皆变，谁能念贫贱。\n岸有经霜草，林有故年枝。\n俱应待春色，独使客心悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}